'''Gravattack''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Galilean]] from the orbit of the planet [[Keplorr]].{{Refn|[[:File:Scan 11.png]]|group = OV Brief}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Gravattack===
Being a silicon-based lifeform,{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Silicon Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} Gravattack is literally a living planet. He is a large, bulky, reddish-brown alien with rocky skin. He is headless, with his face is on his torso, and features a giant mouth with teeth that are also made of rocks,{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Teeth.png]]|group = DJW}} and a molten lava planet core at the center of his body. His feet are tan with three toes, and he has three fingers and one thumb on each hand. He wears black shorts with green stripes, a green belt with white stripes and the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his forehead.

===Albedo as Negative Gravattack===
[[Albedo|Negative]] Gravattack is magenta and red-colored and his core, eyes, and [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol are all red.

===Bad Ben as Bad Gravattack===
[[Bad Ben]]'s Gravattack is violet colored, his core is purple, and his eyes and Omnitrix symbol are mint green.

