==Etymology==
Gravattack's name comes from the combination of "[[Wikipedia:Gravity|gravity]]", his main power, and "attack", the way he mainly uses said power.

==Trivia==
*Like [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], Gravattack's size is portrayed inconsistently in many of his appearances. This was due to a problem with the size comparisons.{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Size Comps Problem.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*The idea of a transformation with gravitational powers was created very early on in production of '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', even before [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] joined the crew.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Came Up With Whampire.png]]|group = DJW}} His name and design were conceived after the powers were.{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Production.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**Gravattack's concept name was Graviton.{{Refn|[[:File:Graviton Proof.PNG]]|group = DJW}} However, this name was rejected by the legal team as there was a [[w:c:Marvel:Graviton|Marvel character of the same name]].{{Refn|https://youtu.be/unaX1hKhOy4|group = CM}}
**It was Derrick's idea for Gravattack to convert into a planetoid form.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Contributions to OV Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Matt Wayne]] believes that targets of Gravattack's gravakinesis reach a structural limit "long before fusion starts",{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Structural Limit.png]]|group = MW}} putting an upper bound to Gravattack's gravikinesis.
**Thus, Gravattack cannot, on his own, create enough gravitational force to create a black hole.{{Refn|[[:File:Matt Wayne Feedback Absorption Limit.png]]|group = MW}}
*Gravattack did not make the cut for the '''[[Ben 10 (2016 TV Series)|Reboot]]''' because he would be too powerful for the [[Earth (Reboot)|Earth]]-bound villains on the show.{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Too OP For RB.png]]|group = DR}}
*[[David Kaye]]'s voice for Gravattack was initially lower, but eventually became similar in direction to his voice for [https://tfwiki.net/wiki/Optimus_Prime_(Animated) Optimus Prime] in [https://tfwiki.net/wiki/Transformers_Animated_(cartoon) '''''Transformers Animated'''''].{{Refn|https://youtu.be/unaX1hKhOy4|group = DK}}

